{"t": 1794104981.6400592, "kind": "call", "tool": "github_create_pull_request", "args": {"base": "main", "body": "## Summary\n\n`catalog.pager.page()` treated page numbers as 0-based, so `page(items, 1, size)` returned the second page even though the API documents page numbers as 1-based (`?page=1` is the first page).\n\nChanged the offset calculation from `number * size` to `(number - 1) * size`.\n\n## Verification\n\n```python\nitems = list(range(1, 26))\npage(items, 1, 10)  # [1..10]\npage(items, 2, 10)  # [11..20]\npage(items, 3, 10)  # [21..25]\n```\n\nFixes #57", "head": "fix/pagination-57", "owner": "acme", "repo": "catalog", "title": "Fix 1-based page numbering in page() (#57)"}, "ok": true}
